<metadata><name>Day 62 (stop 1 of 3) - Ross McLean</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.720386" lon="-80.972986"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Lundy Lane. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.720334" lon="-80.978295"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Ross McLean Side Trail, heading north. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
